# Mandatory AudioWRT distribution-core packages.
# Device-specific hardware packages remain OpenWrt's responsibility.
# The 8 MB reference baseline prioritizes network connectivity and real audio
# outputs; local USB storage/extroot is optional.
#
# Keep the requested general LuCI status/system/package-management pages, but
# do not preinstall luci-mod-network. AudioWRT owns Wi-Fi client and IPv4
# configuration through its dedicated UI.

audiowrt-core
audiowrt-provisioning
audiowrt-audio
audiowrt-usb-audio
audiowrt-bluetooth
audiowrt-extensions
audiowrt-wifi-client
luci-base
luci-theme-bootstrap
luci-mod-status
luci-mod-system
luci-app-package-manager
luci-app-audiowrt
luci-app-audiowrt-wifi-client
luci-app-audiowrt-core
uhttpd
uhttpd-mod-ubus
umdns
dnsmasq
wpad-basic-mbedtls
